      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pitman%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Until August 2014, Pitman, New Jersey was a dry town, prohibiting the sale of alcohol until new ordinances were passed in 2015.",
